   "heading": "Introduction",
   "text": "The Indian state of Meghalaya is divided into 12 districts. Meghalaya is divided into 2 administrative divisions, namely the Garo Hills Division (Western Division), having its headquarters in West Garo Hills District and the Khasi Hills Division (Eastern Division), having its head quarters in the East Khasi Hills District.",
